---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Welcome">
  <style>
    .page{
      max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; padding:130px 32px 140px; text-align:left;
    }
    .eyebrow{
      font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:11px;
      letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--cyan);
      margin-bottom:16px; display:block;
    }
    .page h1{
      font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight:700;
      font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,40px); line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:-.01em;
      margin-bottom:20px;
    }
    .bleed-bar{
      height:2px; width:100%; max-width:280px;
      background:linear-gradient(to right, var(--oxblood) 0%, var(--oxblood) 40%, transparent 100%);
      transform-origin:left; animation:bleedIn 900ms ease-out both;
      margin-bottom:32px;
    }
    @keyframes bleedIn{ from{ transform:scaleX(0); } to{ transform:scaleX(1); } }

    .page p{ font-size:17px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom:22px; max-width:52ch; }
    .page p strong{ color:var(--paper); font-weight:600; }

    .links{ margin-top:36px; display:flex; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .links a{
      font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.06em;
      text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--text-muted); text-decoration:none;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--redact-border); padding-bottom:2px;
    }
    .links a:hover{ color:var(--cyan); border-color:var(--cyan); }
  </style>

  <div class="page">
    <span class="eyebrow">Subscription confirmed</span>
    <h1>You're in.</h1>
    <div class="bleed-bar"></div>

    <p>Here's what that actually means: one email, every time a new case file is filed — no weekly digest, no roundup, no filler. Each one covers a real, reproduced vulnerability or failure pattern in a RAG system, rated by severity, with enough technical detail to tell you if it applies to your own stack.</p>

    <p><strong>No sponsor content, ever.</strong></p>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="/">← All Case Files</a>
      <a href="/about">How cases get verified</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>